<title>UK: Banco BCN Barclays prices $100 mln step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Banco BCN Barclays prices $100 mln step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced</p>
<p>earlier by lead manager BZW has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BCN BARCLAYS SA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON	*9.0     MATURITY    15.MAY.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE    99.566  PAY DATE    15.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  87.5 BP   REOFFER	99.566  SPREAD	+255 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-50-100 SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   #</p>
<p> MGT/UND    62.5 BP   SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR 6.625 UST</p>
<p>NOTES *STEPS-UP ON 15.MAY.02 TO 9.125 PCT IF NOT CALLED AT PAR.</p>
<p>		#STANDARD BRAZIL TAX INCLUDING GROSS UP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
